      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "[Release 3.10.5-beta.1](https://vrc-beta-docs.netlify.app/releases/release-3-10-5):\n\n> Resolved a case where the count of lights on an avatar reported by the validations section could be made to overflow.",
